official value first appears here, conclusion-side.
(Iter-014 repair: the previous exact value
$-(\pi - 2\arctan(2/\sqrt{63})) \approx -151.71^\circ$ was false for this
periapsis-referenced scenario and inconsistent with the stated rounding
band; $-\arctan(2/\sqrt{45}) \approx -16.6015^\circ$ is the
$\varepsilon^2 = 49/4$ value.)
