$\mathrm{roundsToOfficialDegrees}\,(\mathrm{radiansToDegrees}\,
(\mathrm{signedDeflection}\,u))$.
\end{lemma}
\begin{proof}
Rewrite the signed deflection by the assumed exact value and unfold
`roundsToOfficialDegrees`; the two strict bounds of
\cref{lem:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_B_2:arctan_deg_band}
transport across $\delta \mapsto -\delta$ (division by the positive $\pi$
preserves the inequalities).
\end{proof}

